        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'A UAE custody order can be modified if there is a genuine material change of circumstances. Recognised grounds include: the custodial parent remarrying, relocation out of the UAE, inability to provide adequate care, evidence of abuse or neglect, the custodial parent losing their visa, the child\'s own expressed preference (at age 15 under the 2024 law), or new evidence that the current arrangement harms the child\'s wellbeing. The court always applies the best interests of the child as the overriding standard.',
      },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'What can I do immediately if my ex does not return the children after a visit?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
